  "title": "Air Fryer Buffalo-Ranch Chickpeas",
  "description": "These air fryer Buffalo chickpeas are simply seasoned with Buffalo wing sauce and ranch dressing mix for a quick and easy hard-to-resist spicy snack.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
